<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95332" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκύμν-ος</span></b> , ὁ (and ἡ, <i><span class="en">
			E.
			<u>Or.</u>
			1493
		</span></i> (lyr.)), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cub.
			whelp</i>, esp. <i>lion's whelp</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				18.319
			</span></i>; in full, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. λέοντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.32
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				1223
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				1431
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1039
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεαίνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					987
				</span></i>
			; also of other animals, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. λύκων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					699
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λυγγός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lasus
					3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἄρκτου, τῆς
			ἐλέφαντος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				571b30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				578a22
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλώπεκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Lyc.</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in poets also
			of men, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀχίλλειος ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				1170
			</span></i> (anap.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.</u>
				381
			</span></i> (anap.); of women, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1213
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1387
			</span></i> (lyr.).</div>
